      "case_id": "V2-068",
      "question": "两篇检索材料给出矛盾结论，系统应按什么依据选择或展示差异？",
      "category": "paraphrase",
      "split": "dev",
      "group": "R019",
      "variant": "expanded",
      "expected_sources": [
